    "conceptName": "Plugin Framework for Cursor & Claude Code",
    "conceptDescription": "Establish a unified framework structure that enables the agentic-processes system to be used as a plugin/extension for both Cursor IDE and Claude Code environments. This includes defining entry points, configuration patterns, installation procedures, and environment detection mechanisms that allow the framework to operate seamlessly in either context.",
    "targetFiles": "Documentation files, configuration templates, and setup guides that define how the framework integrates as a plugin with Cursor (via skills/rules) and Claude Code (via AGENTS.md/hooks)",
    "existingState": "Framework designed primarily for Claude Code with some Cursor-specific components, but no unified plugin architecture",
    "requestedState": "Clear plugin architecture with documented entry points, configuration patterns, and installation guides for both Cursor and Claude Code environments"
  },
